{"kind": "finding", "id": "F-catchall-050-01", "file": "Source/Parsek.Tests/CopyRewindSaveToRootTests.cs", "line": 248, "method": "NoOp_WhenBothSourcesHaveNoSave", "category": "T1", "severity": "Medium", "confidence": "high", "falsifiability": "falsifiability: Source/Parsek/ParsekFlight.cs:4114; delete the empty-rewindSave early return -> still green; add Assert.Equal(0, root.RewindReservedFunds) -> red", "what_it_asserts": "That the root rewind save filename is still null when neither capture nor recorder fallback has one.", "why_weak": "Root starts null, so the assertion holds with or without the line 4114 early return; the budget copy the return prevents is never asserted.", "proposed_action": "Assert root.RewindReservedFunds/Science/Rep and PreLaunch* stay 0 while the capture carries non-zero values.", "effort": "S", "july_ref": "none"}
